@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Learn modern C#", "priority": "High" }

### Create (invalid -> 400 ProblemDetails)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "   " }

### List all
GET {{host}}/api/tasks

### Filter
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?done=false

### Get one
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/1

### Partial update (send the version from your last GET)
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isDone": true, "version": 1 }

### Same PATCH again -> 409 Conflict (version is now 2)
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "stale write", "version": 1 }

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/tasks/1

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
